window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>The epic conclusion to the DFZ Changeling trilogy!</i></b></p> <p><b>No Victor lasts forever.</b></p> <p>Victor thought he won when he became the Hero. He thought he won when he took over the DFZ. He thought he’d made himself untouchable.</p> <p>He’s wrong.</p> <p>Lola isn’t the sad little monster she used to be. She has a plan, she has allies, she has more magic than she ever dreamed possible. Killing one blood mage should be easy with a fairy kingdom at her fingertips, but Victor didn't make himself a god by playing fair, and his bag of tricks is far from empty. Taking him down will take everything Lola and her friends can bring, but if there’s one thing Lola’s always been, it’s determined. No matter the cost, no matter what it takes, she will see this through.</p> <p>To the bloody end.</p>"; 
